OL,3,GNEWSACare home resident relives ice
OL,4,Acream vendor memories
OL,5,
OL,6,FA care home resident and former ice
OL,7,Fcream vendor has been able to enjoy
OL,8,Fgiving out the treats once again, after
OL,9,Fa surprise experience organised by his
OL,10,Fcarers.
OL,12,FGordon Chambers, 88, worked in Rubery
OL,13,Fand Bromsgrove for 15 years when he was
OL,14,Fyounger, chatting to and meeting the
OL,15,Flocal community.
OL,17,FHis carers at Chandler Court, on
OL,18,FRecreation Road in Bromsgrove, said
OL,19,Fthey arranged for local business, BB
OL,20,FKing Whippy, to visit the home recently
OL,21,Fand help Chambers relive happy
OL,22,Fmemories.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
